#: __init__.py:588
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Delete the active Flattice lattice, remove all associated modifiers, and clean up the camera's flatten property. Auto-selects another lattice in the scene if one exists"
msgstr "删除活动 Flattice 晶格，移除所有关联修改器，并清理摄像机的压平属性。如果场景中存在其他晶格，将自动选择其中一个"

