#: __init__.py:444
msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Enable/disable the Flattice deformation in the viewport.\nRenders are unaffected — this only mutes the Lattice modifiers\nso you can model and navigate against the undeformed geometry"
msgstr "在视图中启用/禁用 Flattice 变形。\n不影响渲染 — 此操作仅静音晶格修改器，\n以便针对未变形几何体进行建模和导航"

