msgctxt "Operator"
msgid "Rebuild the camera property and the shape-key driver for the active\nFlattice. Use if the Flatten slider stops affecting the mesh — e.g.\nafter appending, duplicating, or deleting the driver by hand"
msgstr "为活动 Flattice 重建摄像机属性和形态键驱动器。\n如果压平滑块不再影响网格 — 例如在追加、复制\n或手动删除驱动器后 — 可使用此操作"

